---
import { withBase } from '../utils/path';
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-brand-green/10 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-brand-green mb-3">遇兰玉兰</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-green/70 leading-relaxed">
          玉见兰不住的美好<br />忙里偷闲也发光
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading text-sm font-bold text-brand-green mb-3">导航</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-brand-green/70">
          <li><a href={withBase('/')} class="hover:text-brand-green transition-colors">首页</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/story')} class="hover:text-brand-green transition-colors">品牌故事</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/magie')} class="hover:text-brand-green transition-colors">遇见magie</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/products')} class="hover:text-brand-green transition-colors">春日好物</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/checkin')} class="hover:text-brand-green transition-colors">玉兰打卡</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading text-sm font-bold text-brand-green mb-3">关注我们</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-brand-green/70">
          <li>小红书：遇兰玉兰</li>
          <li>微博：@遇兰玉兰</li>
          <li>微信公众号：遇兰玉兰</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-brand-green/10 text-center text-xs text-brand-green/50">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} 遇兰玉兰 All Rights Reserved. 仅供非商业展示用途。</p>
      <p class="mt-1">品牌名「遇兰玉兰」、IP形象「magie/玉兰鸡」、Logo、图片、文案及视觉资产未经授权禁止商用。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
